        "node_id": "n_1_4807f4",
        "thought_text": "The error occurs because the input parsing for supervisors is incorrect. The code assumes that the supervisors list starts at index N, but it should start at index N+1. This causes an IndexError when trying to access elements beyond the input data. Let's modify the input parsing to correctly handle the supervisors data.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
